      <h2>In-house courses</h2>

      <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-2 row-cols-md-3 g-3">
        <div class="col">
          <p>If you like you could benefit from my in-house training on any aspect of:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Unix/Linux</li>
            <li>GitHub</li>
            <li>Continuous Intergration / Continuous Deployment</li>
            <li>Perl</li>
