      <h2>Slides archive</h2>

      <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-2 row-cols-md-3 g-3">
        <div class="col">
          <p>I've run a lot of public training courses over the couple of
            decades.</p>
          <p>I'm trying to build up an archive of the slides from as many of
            those courses as possible. But it's a project that will involve
            a great deal of hard-disk and cloud storage archeology&mdash;so
            it'll take a while...</p>
          <p>If you saw me talk at a conference or a user group meeting, then
